>>SOURCE FORMAT FREE
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. UTIL.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
COPY COMMON.
01 WS-A PIC 9(5) VALUE 0.
01 WS-B PIC 9(5) VALUE 0.
01 WS-RESULT PIC 9(9) VALUE 0.
01 WS-MSG PIC X(30) VALUE SPACES.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-LOGIC.
    MOVE 100 TO WS-A.
    MOVE 25 TO WS-B.
    COMPUTE WS-RESULT = WS-A + WS-B.
    DISPLAY "UTIL: SUM=" WS-RESULT.
    COMPUTE WS-RESULT = WS-A - WS-B.
    DISPLAY "UTIL: DIFF=" WS-RESULT.
    COMPUTE WS-RESULT = WS-A * WS-B.
    DISPLAY "UTIL: PRODUCT=" WS-RESULT.
    IF WS-A > WS-B THEN
        DISPLAY "UTIL: A IS GREATER"
    ELSE
        DISPLAY "UTIL: B IS GREATER OR EQUAL"
    END-IF.
    EXIT PROGRAM.
